  "sourceSummary": "Muscle and Strength original Wide Grip Cable Curl specifies straight bar at low pulley and hands wider than shoulders. Its grip sentence mistakenly refers to rope/neutral grip despite straight-bar setup; Muscle and Fitness Cable Biceps Curl explicitly describes underhand bar/palms forward and fixed upperarms, supporting the supinated implementation. Editorial8second demonstration.",
